# Generated attraction candidate lists: inputs to a verification run, not artifacts
candidates/

# The task board is a pure function of tasks/open and tasks/done, and every task that is
# filed, claimed or finished rewrites the whole file. Committing it made each of those
# pull requests collide with every other one in the same few table rows (PRs #404, #409,
# #410 in one day), so it is generated on demand instead: `npm run tasks:board`.
tasks/BOARD.md

# Lighthouse CI writes reports here when the SEO audit runs. CI uploads the directory as an
# artifact; a local `lhci autorun` leaves it in the working tree.
.lighthouseci/

# Local Google Drive video SSOT cache and local episode drafts (Route B: Drive-only, 0 GitHub commits).
.cache/video-drive/
work/video-episodes/

